{"version":1,"key":"card:632","content":{"id":632,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"vertical-align ","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"可以设置行内元素在行框中的垂直对齐方式。根据计算来源和计算方式可分为两类："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相对于父元素的属性（"},{"type":"formatted","text":"baseline","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"x-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"）"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"baseline","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：元素的基线相对于行框基线对齐，默认值"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"middle","code":true},{"text":"：元素的垂直方向上的中点对齐到行框基线往上 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"0.5ex","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"text-top","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：元素的顶部对齐到行框内容元素的顶部，内容区由 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"font-size","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 决定而不是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"text-bottom","code":true},{"text":"：元素的底部对齐到行框内容元素的底部","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"<length>","code":true},{"text":"：将元素基线相对于行框基线抬高或降低指定长度（正数抬高，负数降低）","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"<percentage>","code":true},{"text":"：将元素基线相对于行框基线抬高或降低指定百分比（正数抬高，负数降低），这里的百分比是相对于父元素的行高而言的","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sub","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：将元素基线相对于父元素向下移动，是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<sub>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签的默认样式"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"super","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：将元素基线相对于父元素向上移动，是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<sup>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签的默认样式"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相对于行框，待所有元素都初步定位后，根据"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"top","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：元素的顶部与行框顶部对齐"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"bottom","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：元素的底部与行框的底部对齐"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_52512a71-c366-422e-8d0e-c2ab89ca86a9.png","uuid":"7f7091ba-69db-42d2-8b3e-3aabe3a0783d","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_52512a71-c366-422e-8d0e-c2ab89ca86a9.png","width":433.8461385760795},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"为什么是这么分类的？","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"baseline","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"middle","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"text-top","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等值，它们对齐所需要的“标尺”（基线、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"x-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、内容区顶部）是从哪里来的？它们是由父元素的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"font-size","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"font-family","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性预先定义好的。 浏览器在处理一个元素时，可以立即根据父元素的字体属性，知道它应该对齐的基线在哪里。这个参考线是“静态的”、“预先确定的”。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"top","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","text":"bottom","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它们对齐所需要的“标尺”（行框的顶边和底边）是从哪里来的？它们不是由父元素预先定义好的。 它必须先处理完同一行所有的兄弟元素，找出谁最高、谁最低，从而确定整个行框的最终边界。然后，它才能回过头来，把这个元素的顶部对齐到那个最终计算出来的边界上。这个参考线是“动态的”、“事后确定的”。"}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"vertical-align","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 只能用于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"inline","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"inline-block","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"table-cell","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素，不能用于块级元素。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了理解上述表述，我们需要先理解两个概念，行内元素的基线和行框的基线。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"行内元素的基线是什么："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于文本 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"inline","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素，基线是字母 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"x","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的下边缘"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"inline-block","code":true}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"内部存在行框，最后一个行框的基线"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"没有行框，或者 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"overflow","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"hidden","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"scroll","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"auto","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，基线就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"margin-bottom","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 边界，也就是盒模型底部"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于替换元素，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"img","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"input","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"textarea","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，它们是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"inline-block","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素，且内部无内容，没有行框形成，因此基线也是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"margin-bottom","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 边界"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"行框的基线是如何确定的呢？在所有行框中，都会存在一个支柱元素(strut)，它是一个"},{"type":"formatted","text":"零宽字符","color":"#e33a32","darkColor":"#fa7873"},{"text":"，所以不可见，但是继承了父元素的 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"font-size","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"line-height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，它的基线就是行框的基线。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当内联级盒子中包含内联内容才会形成行框盒子。内联内容有两种："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文本内容"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"替换元素或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"display: inline-block","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的元素"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因此一个无任何内容的元素是不会形成行框盒子的，因此也不会形成支柱元素，这样的元素是没有高度的"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<style>\n  p {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    border: 1px solid #1a66ff;\n  }\n</style>\n<p><span></span></p>","language":"HTML","uuid":"8f8dd477-e280-493f-9bec-6a779670c840","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<style>\n  .para {\n    border: 1px solid #1a66ff;\n  }\n</style>\n<p class=\"para\"><span></span></p>","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们添加一个没有内容的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"display: inline-block","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 元素，那么就会形成一个行框盒子，即使没有任何内容，高度也会被支柱元素撑起来"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"<style>\n  p {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    border: 1px solid #1a66ff;\n  }\n  span {\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n</style>\n<p><span></span></p>","language":"HTML","uuid":"9959be08-b5eb-446a-ad5f-f8871f6a155e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<p class=\"para\"><span class=\"inline-block\"></span></p>","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面展示了四种元素的基线对齐："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"行内文本，基线是字母 x 的下边缘"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"包含多行内容的 inline-block，基线是最后一行行框的基线"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不包含内容的 inline-block，基线是盒子的底部"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图片，替换元素，基线是盒子的底部"}]}]}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<style>\n  .line-demo {\n    border: 1px solid #5e4b7a;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .inline-span-demo {\n    display: inline;\n    border: 1px solid #fbda41;\n  }\n  .inline-block-span-demo {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 100px;\n    border: 1px solid #1a66ff;\n  }\n  .inline-block-span-no-content {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 100px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border: 1px solid #1a66ff;\n  }\n  .inline-img {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    border: 1px solid #ff1212;\n    vertical-align: baseline;\n  }\n</style>\n<p class=\"line-demo\">\n  <span class=\"inline-span-demo\">Hello World!</span>\n  <span class=\"inline-block-span-demo\">Hello, Hello, Hello, Hello</span>\n  <span class=\"inline-block-span-no-content\"></span>\n  <img class=\"inline-img\" src=\"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c6f44073-8234-4014-b506-08fefa2918a3.png\" />\n</p","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://juejin.cn/post/7037131631252996126","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一文带你搞懂“幽灵空白节点”的形成"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/vertical-align","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"vertical-align"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}]}]}]}],"tags":["CSS/排版","CSS/vertical-align"],"createTime":1758847148709,"updateTime":1780382639794,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card",